## Summary
The University of Utah has announced the closure of its satellite campus after more than 25 years of operation. The decision was reported in August 2026 by Inside Higher Ed.

## Key Points
- The University of Utah is shutting down a satellite campus.
- The campus has been operational for over 25 years.
- The closure is scheduled for 2026.
- The announcement was made in August 2026.


